  ok   the envelope cuts that dependence by more than 3x
       600-3000 Hz over 1.2 octaves: raw 0.67 dB, envelope 8.85 dB (both fine; the raw one is used there)
  ok   envelope is deterministic

[G18] a UI trim changes the applied EQ, never the measurement
