  ok   the measurement is untouched by the trim                0.000 (want 0.000 +-0.000)
  ok   clearing the trim restores the proposal                -2.500 (want -2.500 +-0.010)

[G4] correction effectiveness
  ok   resonance band reduced by >3 dB                         5.858 (want 8.000 +-5.000)
  ok   sub energy reduced by >6 dB (HPF)                       9.009 (want 12.000 +-8.000)
  ok   HPF corner stays in a sane range
       HPF 130 Hz, 3 corrective bands, 2 notches

